from root_resilience_author import *
U=[]
U.append(unit('入滲量與地下水補注量~Infiltration versus aquifer recharge',
'進入補注池底的水不一定立即抵達區域地下水面，因為中間包氣帶可以暫存水分，也可能產生側向流、蒸散或滯留在低滲透層上方。水量帳應先選定控制體，再區分池面收支、包氣帶儲量與真正穿越地下水面的補注。只把池內水位下降全當補注，容易混入蒸發、池體滲漏到其他區域及量測誤差。教學上先以簡單守恆建立概念，再說明需要時間序列與地下觀測，才能把地表入滲事件和後續含水層回應連結起來。~Water entering a recharge-basin floor does not necessarily reach the regional water table immediately. The unsaturated zone can store moisture, route water laterally or retain it above restrictive layers, while evapotranspiration removes some water. Define the control volume before separating basin balance, vadose storage and flux across the water table. Treating every basin-level decline as recharge mixes evaporation and other pathways into the estimate. Begin with conservation, then use temporal and subsurface observations to connect infiltration events with later aquifer response.',
'教學假設一天池底入滲1000 m³，其中包氣帶儲量增加300 m³、側向離開控制體100 m³，其他項為零；跨越底部地下水面的補注量為600 m³。~Assume one day of 1000 m³ basin-floor infiltration, 300 m³ increase in vadose storage and 100 m³ lateral outflow, with other terms zero. Recharge crossing the lower water-table boundary is 600 m³.',
'在剖面圖上標明每個流量穿越哪個邊界，核對儲量變化的正負號與期間。把池面蒸發、地下側向流和水位反應分開記錄，使用不同深度的含水量資料檢查暫存量，避免以同一個水位數字同時代表兩個控制體。~Mark which boundary each flux crosses and check the sign and interval of storage change. Record evaporation, lateral subsurface flow and groundwater response separately, using moisture observations at multiple depths to assess temporary storage rather than assigning one level measurement to two different control volumes.',
'若把包氣帶暫存水直接記為已補入含水層，會高估短期補注績效。後續暫存水逐漸向下移動時，又可能被重複記帳，造成同一批水在不同月份被算成兩次補注。~Crediting vadose storage as completed aquifer recharge overstates short-term performance. When that stored water later moves downward, it may be counted again, recording the same water twice across different accounting periods.',
'補注池水位下降的全部水量，都等於同一天已經抵達區域含水層的補注量。~Every basin-level loss equals aquifer recharge completed on the same day.',
'畫出池體、包氣帶與飽和含水層三個控制體，建立連續兩日水量帳。第二日停止供水但允許包氣帶釋水，說明為何池底入滲為零時地下水補注仍可能持續，並檢查跨日總量是否守恆。~Draw basin, vadose-zone and saturated-aquifer control volumes and prepare a two-day balance. Stop supply on day two while allowing stored moisture to drain, explaining why recharge may continue without new basin infiltration and checking conservation across both days.'))
U.append(unit('濕潤前緣與包氣帶儲存~Wetting fronts and vadose storage',
'簡化活塞式濕潤前緣把入滲水視為逐步填補土壤含水量差，前緣前進距離可由累積入滲深度除以體積含水量增量估算。這個模型忽略優勢流、氣體困陷與前緣擴散，不能代表所有地層。初始含水量越高，同一入滲水量需要填補的孔隙儲存越少，理想前緣可能更深；但實際流速仍取決於不飽和傳導特性。應把水量幾何估算與動力學分開，不能由前緣深度公式直接推定精確到達時間。~A piston-style wetting front treats infiltration as filling a moisture deficit. Cumulative infiltration depth divided by volumetric moisture increase estimates front depth, ignoring preferential flow, trapped gas and diffuse wetting. A wetter initial profile requires less added storage for the same depth, but actual movement also depends on unsaturated conductivity. Separate this geometric storage estimate from flow dynamics: the relation explains how much water is needed under ideal assumptions, not exactly when a front reaches a particular layer.',
'教學假設均勻初始體積含水量0.10、濕潤後0.30，累積入滲深度0.60 m，無側流或蒸發；理想濕潤深度z=0.60/(0.30−0.10)=3.0 m。~Assume uniform initial volumetric water content 0.10, wetted content 0.30 and cumulative infiltration depth 0.60 m, with no lateral loss or evaporation. Ideal wetting depth is 0.60/(0.30−0.10)=3.0 m.',
'將體積含水量以無量綱比例表示，核對入滲深度是每單位地表面積的水量。以多深度感測資料觀察前緣是否清楚，若出現先深後淺的到達或不連續反應，應檢查優勢流和感測代表性，不強迫資料符合均勻活塞模型。~Express volumetric contents as dimensionless fractions and verify that infiltration depth is volume per ground area. Examine multiple depths for a distinct front; early deep responses or discontinuities should trigger checks for preferential flow and sensor representativeness rather than forcing observations into a uniform piston model.',
'把百分比直接代入而未換成比例，會讓估算深度差一百倍。忽略初始濕度差異，也會把乾季與濕季的前緣速度差誤認成設備性能變化，掩蓋真正的土壤儲存作用。~Entering percentages without conversion produces a hundredfold error. Ignoring initial moisture differences can also misinterpret seasonal wetting behavior as equipment deterioration, obscuring the role of available soil storage in the observed response.',
'相同入滲水量在任何初始含水量下，都會產生完全相同的濕潤前緣深度。~Equal infiltrated volume produces the same wetting-front depth regardless of initial moisture.',
'將初始含水量改成0.20而保持其餘假設不變，重算前緣深度。再畫出一條快速裂隙路徑，說明為何均勻模型無法預測最早到達，並指出需增加哪種分層或示蹤資料才能檢驗假設。~Change initial moisture to 0.20 while retaining other assumptions and recalculate depth. Sketch a fast fracture pathway, explain why the uniform model cannot predict earliest arrival, and identify layered or tracer observations needed to evaluate its assumptions.'))
U.append(unit('限制層與串聯水力阻抗~Restrictive layers and series hydraulic resistance',
'垂直流經多層土壤時，各層的水頭損失相加，厚度除以水力傳導係數代表該層在單位面積下的阻抗。很薄但低傳導性的層可能控制整個剖面的通量，因此只取各層傳導係數的算術平均通常不適合串聯流動。此處採飽和、定常、一維及相同截面假設，便於理解限制層；真實補注的包氣帶可能不飽和、形成滯水或側流，需要其他模型。辨識薄弱層的連續性與範圍，往往比只量地表材料更重要。~For vertical flow through layers, head losses add, and thickness divided by conductivity represents resistance per unit area. A thin low-conductivity layer can control the total flux, so arithmetic averaging of conductivities generally fails for series flow. The teaching model assumes saturated steady one-dimensional flow through equal areas to isolate this mechanism. Actual vadose recharge may involve unsaturation, perched water and lateral diversion, making the continuity and extent of restrictive layers as important as the properties of surface material.',
'教學假設飽和定常串聯兩層，厚度1與0.20 m，K分別1與0.01 m/day，總水頭差1 m；通量q=1/(1/1+0.20/0.01)=0.04762 m/day。~For two saturated steady layers in series, thicknesses are 1 and 0.20 m, conductivities 1 and 0.01 m/day and total head difference 1 m. Flux is 1/(1/1+0.20/0.01)=0.04762 m/day.',
'逐層計算阻抗與水頭損失，確認相同通量穿越每層且損失總和等於施加差值。把薄低滲透層的橫向延續範圍列為調查項，並比較多個鑽孔，避免將單點未見限制層誤判為整個補注池下方都沒有。~Calculate each resistance and head loss, confirming common flux and closure of the imposed head difference. Investigate lateral continuity of the restrictive layer and compare multiple boreholes, rather than treating its absence at one location as evidence that the entire basin footprint is unrestricted.',
'把兩層傳導係數平均後直接計算，可能大幅高估通量。即使薄層只占很小厚度，也可能控制水頭分布並造成上方積水，讓表面看似良好的入滲條件無法延續到深層。~Averaging the two conductivities directly can greatly overstate flux. A thin restrictive layer may dominate head loss and create perched storage above it, preventing favorable surface infiltration conditions from extending through the deeper profile.',
'限制層只要很薄，就不可能控制整個地層剖面的垂直入滲通量。~A thin restrictive layer can never control vertical flux through the full profile.',
'將限制層厚度減半而保持其他條件不變，重算總通量與各層水頭損失。再把限制層改成不連續透鏡體，說明一維串聯假設哪裡失效，以及為何需要側向流動和空間調查資料補充判讀。~Halve restrictive-layer thickness and recalculate flux and head losses. Replace it conceptually with a discontinuous lens, identify where the one-dimensional series assumption fails, and explain why lateral-flow assessment and spatial investigation become necessary.'))
U.append(unit('比出水量與地下水位隆起~Specific yield and groundwater mounding',
'非受壓含水層水位升高時，新增水量主要填入可排水孔隙，因此可用比出水量連結面積、水位變化與儲量。這種集總水量估算並未計算隆起的空間形狀，也忽略同步側向流出、抽水及延遲排水。若觀測井位於補注池附近，局部隆起可能遠高於整個區域的平均水位增量。課程要求先界定有效面積和時間尺度，再辨認比出水量與總孔隙率的差別，避免把一口井的水位乘上任意區域面積就稱為補注總量。~In an unconfined aquifer, added storage fills drainable pore space, allowing specific yield to relate area, water-level rise and volume. This lumped estimate does not resolve mound shape and omits simultaneous lateral drainage, pumping and delayed yield. A well near a recharge basin may record much more rise than the regional mean. Define area and timescale, distinguish specific yield from total porosity, and avoid multiplying one local well response by an arbitrary regional area to infer recharge volume.',
'教學假設均勻非受壓區域面積10000 m²、比出水量0.20，短期淨儲量增加1000 m³且無側向流出；平均水位升高Δh=1000/(10000×0.20)=0.50 m。~Assume a uniform unconfined area of 10000 m², specific yield 0.20 and net storage addition 1000 m³, with no lateral outflow during the interval. Mean rise is 1000/(10000×0.20)=0.50 m.',
'以多口井檢查空間水位變化，將局部隆起與區域平均分開估算。核對比出水量來源及適用排水時間，並在水量帳中另列抽水與側向排出，確認模型使用的是淨儲量而非未扣損失的總供水量。~Use multiple wells to distinguish local mounding from regional average rise. Check the provenance and drainage timescale of specific yield, and account separately for pumping and lateral discharge so the storage calculation uses net retained water rather than gross basin supply.',
'用總孔隙率取代比出水量，可能把不能在分析期間釋出的水也算入有效儲存。把池邊最高水位代表整片含水層，則可能高估區域儲量，兩種誤差需要不同觀測才能分辨。~Substituting total porosity for specific yield includes water that may not drain on the analysis timescale. Extending the highest basin-edge head across the entire aquifer can overstate regional storage; these errors require different observations to resolve.',
'任何一口井測到的水位隆起，都可以直接代表整個補注區域的平均水位變化。~The rise measured at any single well automatically represents the mean rise across the recharge area.',
'保持淨儲量不變，分別將有效面積加倍與比出水量減半，重算平均水位。再畫出中心高、邊緣低的隆起剖面，提出能估算區域平均的觀測配置，並說明哪個參數仍需要獨立證據。~Keep net storage fixed, double effective area and halve specific yield in separate scenarios, then recalculate mean rise. Sketch a mound with a high center and lower edges, proposing observations for regional averaging and identifying parameters that still require independent evidence.'))
U.append(unit('氣體困陷與有效導水截面~Gas entrapment and effective flow area',
'補注造成水位上升或濕潤前緣移動時，孔隙內氣體可能被困住，改變可供水流的連通路徑。氣體效應不等同於細粒堵塞，也不能由總孔隙率直接推算，因為氣泡位置、孔喉形狀及溶解過程都會影響導水能力。Sand Hollow研究把水力和水化學資料並用，提供氣體相關機制的實際研究背景；本課的簡化截面模型只用於辨別幾何量與流量的關係，不把假設的氣體比例套用到該水庫或當作現地診斷公式。~Rising groundwater or a moving wetting front can trap pore gas and alter connected water-flow pathways. Gas effects differ from particle clogging and cannot be inferred from total porosity alone, because bubble location, pore throats and dissolution matter. Sand Hollow research combines hydraulic and hydrochemical evidence as context for this mechanism. The teaching area model isolates geometry and flux without assigning its hypothetical gas fraction to that reservoir or treating it as a field diagnostic law.',
'教學幾何假設總截面10 m²、原可流動孔隙面積比例0.30，其中20%被氣體阻斷；有效流動面積10×0.30×0.80=2.4 m²。若流量固定0.24 m³/day，該簡式平均速度0.10 m/day，未推算K。~Assume a 10 m² section, connected pore-area fraction 0.30 and 20% blockage of that area by gas. Effective area is 2.4 m². At fixed discharge 0.24 m³/day, geometric mean velocity is 0.10 m/day; conductivity is not inferred.',
'把氣體比例明確定義為哪個面積或體積的比例，檢查是否誤與總孔隙率相加。比較流量、水頭、溶解氣體及溫度的時間變化，評估不同成因能否解釋同一資料，不用單一水力指標直接宣稱已證實氣體困陷。~Define whether gas fraction refers to an area or volume and check that it is not incorrectly added to total porosity. Compare discharge, head, dissolved-gas and temperature trends, evaluating competing explanations instead of claiming that one hydraulic metric alone proves trapped gas.',
'把阻斷孔隙比例直接當成水力傳導係數下降比例，會忽略孔喉連通性的非線性影響。若所有入滲衰減都歸因於氣體，也可能漏掉細粒、生物或區域梯度變化造成的同時作用。~Equating blocked pore fraction with proportional conductivity decline ignores nonlinear connectivity. Assigning every infiltration decrease to gas can also overlook particles, biological effects or regional gradient changes acting at the same time.',
'孔隙氣體占比降低多少，水力傳導係數就必定以完全相同的百分比提高。~Reducing gas-filled pore fraction always increases conductivity by exactly the same percentage.',
'把假設阻斷比例改為40%，保持流量不變，重算有效面積與幾何平均速度。再說明若實際流量隨阻抗改變，固定流量假設就不成立，並列出需要量測的壓力、氣體和流量資料以檢驗因果。~Change blockage to 40% at fixed discharge and recalculate effective area and geometric velocity. Explain why variable discharge would invalidate that assumption, then list pressure, gas and flow observations needed to evaluate the causal interpretation.'))
U.append(unit('入滲衰減與觀測期間~Declining infiltration and observation windows',
'補注池入滲率常隨時間改變，可能同時反映土壤濕潤、池底沉積、氣體效應與地下水位隆起。把整段紀錄擬合成指數衰減，只是資料摘要，不代表每個因素都遵循相同機制。短期試驗若在最初高入滲率時就結束，可能高估持續供水能力；反之，單一低值也可能只是暫時水頭變化。教學上使用明列的經驗曲線計算累積水量，並要求將曲線參數與可獨立觀測的現象對照，而非把擬合參數直接命名為某種堵塞常數。~Basin infiltration can vary with wetting, surface deposition, gas effects and groundwater mounding. An exponential fit summarizes observations but does not prove a shared physical mechanism. Ending a trial during initially high infiltration can overstate sustained capacity, while one low value may reflect temporary head conditions. Use a declared empirical curve to calculate cumulative volume and compare its parameters with independently observed processes rather than labeling a fitted coefficient as a definitive clogging constant.',
'教學經驗曲線f(t)=0.05+0.15e^(−0.5t) m/day，t以日計；四日累積入滲深度為0.05×4+0.15/0.5×(1−e^−2)=0.4594 m。固定池面面積1000 m²時，體積459.4 m³。~For the hypothetical empirical curve f(t)=0.05+0.15 exp(−0.5t) m/day with t in days, four-day infiltration depth is 0.4594 m. At constant basin area 1000 m², volume is 459.4 m³.',
'用細時間步長數值加總與解析積分互相核對，確認衰減係數單位為每日而非無量綱。把池水深、地下水位與供水中斷一起標在紀錄中，並保留未參與擬合的時段檢驗外推誤差，不能只看訓練資料的擬合優度。~Cross-check numerical integration against the analytic integral and confirm inverse-day units for the decay coefficient. Record basin depth, groundwater levels and supply interruptions, reserving an unused period to assess extrapolation rather than relying only on fit quality within the calibration window.',
'將初始入滲率乘上整個運轉期間，會忽略後續衰減而高估體積。把經驗曲線延伸到遠超過觀測期間，也可能誤把暫時趨勢當成長期穩定行為，產生缺乏證據的容量承諾。~Multiplying the initial rate by the full operating period overestimates volume when rates decline. Extrapolating far beyond observations can also mistake a temporary trend for stable long-term behavior, producing unsupported claims about sustained recharge capacity.',
'指數曲線擬合良好，就足以證明入滲衰減只有一種已知堵塞機制。~A good exponential fit proves that infiltration decline has one uniquely identified clogging mechanism.',
'以一天為步長用左端點法估算四日入滲量，再縮短步長與解析值比較。將衰減係數減半，說明累積量如何改變，並指出要判斷這是材料變化還是水頭變化，還缺少哪些獨立觀測。~Estimate four-day infiltration using daily left endpoints, refine the timestep and compare with the analytic result. Halve the decay coefficient, assess cumulative volume and identify additional observations needed to distinguish material changes from changing hydraulic head.'))
U.append(unit('水質混合與質量負荷~Water-quality mixing and mass loading',
'補注水的水質評估不能只看濃度變低，因為總污染物負荷取決於水量與濃度的乘積。兩股水混合的理想濃度可由質量守恆得到，但這並不代表反應性物質、病原體或微量污染物都能用同一公式判斷風險。地下地球化學還可能使原本存在的物質釋出，因此進水合格與含水層反應需要分別檢驗。課程只使用假想保守溶質說明混合與負荷，明確排除把稀釋計算當作水質處理或用途核准的替代方式。~Quality assessment must distinguish concentration from mass load, which depends on both volume and concentration. Ideal mixing follows mass balance, but reactive substances, pathogens and trace contaminants do not share one universal risk relation. Aquifer geochemistry may mobilize pre-existing constituents, requiring separate evaluation of incoming water and subsurface response. The teaching example uses a hypothetical conservative solute to explain mixing and loading, explicitly separating dilution arithmetic from treatment performance and acceptance for any particular use.',
'教學假設保守溶質及體積可加，100 m³水濃度10 mg/L與200 m³水濃度40 mg/L混合；總質量9 kg，混合濃度30 mg/L。此計算沒有去除任何溶質。~Assume a conservative solute and additive volumes: 100 m³ at 10 mg/L mixes with 200 m³ at 40 mg/L. Total mass is 9 kg and mixture concentration 30 mg/L; no solute is removed.',
'將每股水量先換成公升再計算質量，反代混合濃度檢查守恆。確認採樣與水量期間一致，並為反應性指標另列需要的化學與水文資料，不能因保守示蹤物符合混合式，就推論所有水質項目都受同樣控制。~Convert volumes consistently before calculating mass and back-check the mixed concentration. Align sampling with volume intervals and identify additional chemical and hydrologic evidence for reactive constituents, avoiding the inference that agreement for one conservative tracer validates every other water-quality parameter.',
'看到濃度降低就宣稱污染物已被去除，會混淆稀釋與處理。若低濃度水量大幅增加，總質量仍可能上升；忽略地下反應則可能讓只檢查入口的監測方案漏掉後續變化。~Interpreting a lower concentration as removal confuses dilution with treatment. A larger volume can increase total load despite lower concentration, and ignoring subsurface reactions can leave an inlet-only monitoring program unable to detect subsequent changes.',
'混合後濃度降低，就表示污染物總質量一定已經被去除。~A lower concentration after mixing necessarily means pollutant mass has been removed.',
'保持兩股水的濃度不變，將低濃度水量加倍，重算混合濃度與總質量。用兩張圖分別呈現濃度和負荷，說明為何兩者可往不同方向變化，並列出不能由這個保守混合模型回答的水質問題。~Double the lower-concentration volume while keeping both concentrations fixed, then recompute concentration and total load. Plot the two measures separately, explain why they may change differently, and identify quality questions that the conservative mixing model cannot answer.'))
U.append(unit('熱訊號與水流示蹤~Thermal signals and water-flow tracing',
'補注水與原地下水溫度不同時，可以利用熱訊號協助辨識流動，但熱量同時由水攜帶並與固體骨架交換，也會因導熱擴散。熱前緣通常不能直接當成同速度移動的保守溶質前緣。簡化局部熱平衡模型以總體積熱容量比較水所攜帶的熱容量，得到熱傳輸相對水流的延遲因子；這仍忽略非均質、非平衡與邊界熱通量。監測時應與水位和其他示蹤物一起判讀，不因溫度先變或後變就單獨推定整批水的來源比例。~Temperature contrasts can help trace recharge, but heat is advected by water, exchanged with solids and spread by conduction. A thermal front cannot simply be treated as a conservative-solute front moving at pore-water speed. A local-equilibrium approximation compares bulk heat capacity with the moving-water contribution to estimate thermal retardation, while omitting heterogeneity, nonequilibrium and boundary heat fluxes. Interpret temperature alongside heads and other tracers rather than inferring complete source-water proportions from the timing of temperature change alone.',
'教學假設孔隙率0.25、水與固體體積熱容量分別4.18與2.0 MJ/(m³·K)，局部熱平衡；R=[0.25×4.18+0.75×2.0]/(0.25×4.18)=2.435。孔隙水速0.20 m/day時，理想熱前緣速約0.0821 m/day。~For porosity 0.25 and water and solid volumetric heat capacities 4.18 and 2.0 MJ/(m³·K), local-equilibrium retardation is 2.435. Pore-water velocity 0.20 m/day gives ideal thermal-front velocity about 0.0821 m/day.',
'核對熱容量是每單位水體、固體或總體積的定義，避免重複乘孔隙率。比較多深度溫度曲線與已知供水溫度，並檢查季節背景和導熱影響；以其他示蹤物確認水體來源，不能只用熱前緣時間反推出唯一流速。~Check whether heat capacities refer to water, solid or bulk volume to avoid duplicate porosity factors. Compare depth-dependent temperatures with supply temperature and seasonal conductive effects, using additional tracers to constrain water origin rather than deriving a unique flow velocity solely from thermal arrival.',
'把熱前緣延遲全部歸因於水流速度變慢，會忽略固體儲熱與導熱。若地表季節溫度本來就有相似週期，還可能把自然背景誤認為補注訊號，需要獨立的供水與監測紀錄。~Assigning all thermal delay to slow water movement ignores solid heat storage and conduction. Similar seasonal surface-temperature cycles can also imitate recharge signals, requiring independent supply and background observations before attributing the measured change.',
'熱前緣一定與保守溶質以完全相同速度移動，不受土壤固體熱容量影響。~Thermal fronts always move at conservative-solute speed, unaffected by solid heat capacity.',
'將固體熱容量加倍，保持孔隙率與水流速度不變，重算熱延遲因子。畫出水流與熱訊號的兩條時間線，再加入季節性邊界變化，說明哪些觀測有助於區分熱交換、傳導和真正的補注水到達。~Double solid heat capacity at fixed porosity and pore velocity and recalculate retardation. Draw separate water and thermal timelines, add a seasonal boundary variation, and explain which observations help distinguish heat exchange, conduction and arrival of recharge water.'))
U.append(unit('儲存回收效率與合格水量~Storage-recovery efficiency and acceptable volume',
'含水層儲存回收的效率必須明確定義回收水量的水質條件與觀測期間。抽出總量可能大於符合指定用途條件的水量，而其中也可能混入原地下水，因此單一比例不能同時代表水源回收率、抽水效率和水質效果。教學指標以符合預先定義條件的回收量除以注入量，並保留未回收、水質不符及背景混合等資訊。此課不設定真實水質門檻，而是要求在比較方案前先統一分子、分母和邊界，避免透過改換定義製造較高績效。~Aquifer storage-recovery efficiency requires an explicit quality condition and accounting period. Total pumped volume can exceed the portion meeting a predefined use condition and may include native groundwater, so one percentage cannot represent source-water recovery, pumping performance and quality simultaneously. The teaching metric divides acceptable recovered volume by injected volume while recording unrecovered storage and mixing separately. No real acceptance threshold is prescribed; comparisons require consistent numerators, denominators and boundaries rather than improved scores obtained by changing definitions.',
'教學假設注入10000 m³，後續抽回8000 m³，其中6500 m³符合預先假設的教學條件；條件合格回收效率65%，總抽回量比80%，兩者不同，且都不直接識別水分子來源。~Assume injection of 10000 m³, pumping of 8000 m³ and 6500 m³ meeting a predefined hypothetical condition. Acceptable recovery efficiency is 65%, versus a gross pumped-volume ratio of 80%; neither directly identifies molecular source.',
'將注入、抽回、符合條件與不符合條件的水量分欄，逐項核對期間和量測方法。檢查比較情境是否使用相同教學條件及儲存時間，若要分辨原地下水比例，另需示蹤或混合分析，不以水量表本身宣稱完成來源辨識。~Tabulate injected, pumped, acceptable and unacceptable volumes with matching periods and measurement methods. Compare scenarios only under consistent hypothetical criteria and storage durations; determining native-water contribution additionally requires tracers or mixing analysis rather than source attribution from volume meters alone.',
'只報告總抽回量比，可能掩蓋部分水未符合預先設定條件。改變條件或延長抽水期間後直接與舊值比較，也可能造成績效似乎提升，實際卻只是統計邊界改變。~Reporting only gross pumped volume can conceal water failing the predefined condition. Changing criteria or extending the pumping period before comparison can create apparent improvement that actually results from different accounting boundaries rather than better storage performance.',
'總抽回量占注入量百分之八十，就代表有百分之八十的注入水已符合所有使用條件。~Pumping eighty percent of injected volume proves eighty percent of injected water meets every use condition.',
'保持注入與總抽回量不變，改變符合教學條件的水量並比較兩種指標。再加入原地下水混合情境，指出哪些結論只能由水量帳得到，哪些需要額外示蹤證據，最後寫出可供他人重現的指標定義。~Keep injection and gross pumping fixed while changing acceptable volume and compare both metrics. Add native-water mixing, distinguish conclusions supported by balances from those requiring tracers, and write a reproducible definition of each reported performance measure.'))
U.append(unit('停供期間、容量與長期水量帳~Supply interruptions, capacity and long-term accounting',
'人工補注設施的年水量不只取決於瞬時入滲能力，也受水源可用時間、維護停運、池體輪替和下游含水層容納條件限制。把最大能力乘上一整年會隱含全年滿載且沒有任何限制，通常需要證據才能成立。簡單可用率模型可以拆開容量與運轉時間，但不同停運原因可能相互重疊，不能直接把比例相加扣除。課程以清楚的時間分類練習計算，並要求將入池量、入滲量和最終補注量保持獨立，避免同一個年度數字跨越不同邊界。~Annual managed recharge depends on source-water availability, maintenance, basin rotation and aquifer acceptance as well as instantaneous infiltration capacity. Multiplying maximum capacity by a full year assumes continuous unrestricted operation. A simple availability model separates capacity from operating time, but overlapping outages cannot be subtracted twice. Use explicit time categories and maintain distinctions among basin delivery, infiltration and eventual aquifer recharge so one annual number is not silently transferred between different physical accounting boundaries.',
'教學假設容量1000 m³/day，365日中水源可用300日，其中另有不重疊維護停運20日，運轉日均達容量80%；入池量1000×(300−20)×0.80=224000 m³/year，尚非地下水補注量。~Assume capacity 1000 m³/day, source availability on 300 days, 20 additional nonoverlapping maintenance days within them and operation at 80% capacity. Annual basin delivery is 224000 m³, not yet aquifer recharge.',
'用日曆逐日分類水源缺乏、維護與可運轉時間，確認重疊停運只計一次。將實際每日流量加總與簡化可用率結果比較，再另核對池面損失及包氣帶儲存，不能把供水表總量直接填入最終含水層補注欄。~Classify source outages, maintenance and available operation on a daily calendar, counting overlapping interruptions only once. Compare summed daily flows with the availability approximation, then account separately for basin losses and vadose storage instead of copying delivery-meter totals into the aquifer-recharge column.',
'將兩種重疊停運比例相加，會低估可運轉時間；用額定容量乘全年則可能高估入池量。即使年度入池量計算正確，忽略儲存延遲仍可能把當年供水錯列成當年已完成補注。~Adding overlapping outage fractions understates available time, while multiplying nameplate capacity by a full year can overstate delivery. Even correct annual basin inflow can be misclassified as same-year recharge when subsurface storage delays are ignored.',
'設備額定日容量乘以三百六十五，就一定等於每年實際完成的地下水補注量。~Rated daily capacity multiplied by 365 always equals actual annual aquifer recharge.',
'將十日維護安排改到原本無水源的日期，重算年度入池量並說明重疊時間的效果。再加入年底包氣帶存量增加，建立跨年度水量帳，區分設施利用率提升與含水層實際補注增加是否為同一件事。~Move ten maintenance days into existing source outages and recalculate annual delivery. Add increased year-end vadose storage, prepare a cross-year balance, and distinguish improved facility utilization from an actual increase in recharge reaching the aquifer during that year.'))
S=[source('usgs-artificial-recharge','美國地調所人工地下水補注','USGS artificial groundwater recharge','USGS','https://www.usgs.gov/mission-areas/water-resources/science/artificial-groundwater-recharge','地表補注、井注入及儲存回收概念；不提供本課假設數字。','Surface recharge, injection and storage-recovery concepts; course numbers are independently assumed.'),source('usgs-unsaturated-recharge','包氣帶流動在人工補注中的角色','The role of unsaturated flow in artificial recharge','USGS / Alan L. Flint','https://water.usgs.gov/ogw/pubs/ofr0289/alf_role.htm','2002年原研究說明分層、滯水與包氣帶重要性；不移用特定場址參數。','The 2002 firsthand study explains layering, perched water and vadose-zone importance; site-specific parameters are not transferred.'),source('usgs-sand-hollow-gas','Sand Hollow補注氣體堵塞研究','Sand Hollow recharge and gas-clogging study','USGS / Heilweil and Marston','https://www.usgs.gov/publications/evaluation-potential-gas-clogging-associated-managed-aquifer-recharge-a-spreading','2013年研究摘要核對水庫補注與氣體效應背景，課程截面算例非該場址數值。','The 2013 research abstract verifies reservoir-recharge and gas-effect context; teaching cross-section numbers are not site values.'),source('ocwd-gwrs-faq','橘郡地下水補注系統官方問答','OCWD groundwater replenishment system FAQ','Orange County Water District','https://www.ocwd.com/gwrs/frequently-asked-questions/','2008啟用、2015及2023擴建里程碑與地表補注背景；不引用現行容量或水質標準。','Commissioning in 2008, expansions in 2015 and 2023, and surface-recharge context; no current capacity or quality-standard claims are adopted.')]
save('b297',focus='包氣帶儲存、分層阻抗、補注監測與回收效率~Vadose storage, layered resistance, recharge monitoring and recovery efficiency',summary='以橘郡地下水補注系統與Sand Hollow研究為背景，從地表入滲一路追蹤到含水層儲存與回收。十個原創單元包含濕潤前緣、限制層、地下水隆起、氣體困陷、入滲衰減、水質質量帳與熱示蹤，要求逐一辨識控制體、時間尺度和模型限制。~Use Orange County recharge and Sand Hollow research as context to follow infiltration into aquifer storage and recovery. Ten original units examine wetting fronts, restrictive layers, mounding, trapped gas, declining infiltration, mass accounting and thermal tracing, making control volumes, timescales and model limitations explicit.',history='人工補注不是單純把水倒入地下，而是水源處理、地表設施、包氣帶與含水層共同作用的系統。橘郡GWRS官方問答記錄2008年啟用，並在2015與2023年擴建，提供水回用與地下水管理的背景。USGS於2013年發表Sand Hollow補注研究，利用水力及水化學資料探討氣體相關效應。兩者不是相同地質或相同處理系統，本課以比較方式學習證據如何支持判斷，所有簡式參數均為獨立假設，不將案例成果直接移植到未調查的場址。~Managed recharge links source treatment, surface facilities, the vadose zone and aquifers. OCWD records GWRS commissioning in 2008 and expansions in 2015 and 2023 as context for reuse and groundwater management. A USGS Sand Hollow study published in 2013 examines gas-related effects using hydraulic and hydrochemical observations. These examples have different geology and treatment arrangements. The course compares how evidence supports interpretation while keeping all simplified-model parameters hypothetical rather than transferring case outcomes to an uninvestigated site.',example='教學假設一天有1000 m³水穿越補注池底，其中300 m³增加包氣帶儲存、100 m³側向離開控制體，剩600 m³才穿越下方地下水面。第二天即使停止供水，前一天的暫存水仍可能繼續向下移動，所以地表入滲與地下水補注不能逐日直接畫等號。另一個獨立算例以10000 m³注入量、8000 m³總抽回量及6500 m³符合假設條件的水量，得到80%總抽回比與65%條件合格回收效率。請保持指標邊界一致，並以獨立示蹤資料評估來源，而非將水量比例當成水質或分子來源證明。~Assume 1000 m³ crosses a basin floor in one day, with 300 m³ retained in vadose storage and 100 m³ leaving laterally. Only 600 m³ crosses the lower water-table boundary during that interval. Stored moisture may continue draining after supply stops the next day, so daily infiltration and recharge are not interchangeable. In a separate recovery example, 10000 m³ is injected, 8000 m³ pumped and 6500 m³ meets a hypothetical condition, yielding an 80% gross pumping ratio and 65% acceptable recovery efficiency. Keep definitions and periods consistent, and use independent tracers for source attribution rather than interpreting volume ratios as proof of quality or molecular origin.',facts=['本課10個單元追蹤入滲、儲存與回收的不同邊界。~The 10 units distinguish infiltration, storage and recovery boundaries.','教學1000 m³入滲不等於同日600 m³補注以外的暫存量。~Teaching infiltration of 1000 m³ includes storage beyond the 600 m³ same-day recharge.','教學濕潤前緣3.0 m是假設均勻活塞流的結果。~The teaching 3.0 m wetting front assumes uniform piston flow.','教學薄限制層使串聯通量為0.04762 m/day。~The teaching thin restrictive layer yields series flux 0.04762 m/day.','教學混合濃度30 mg/L仍保留9 kg溶質。~The teaching 30 mg/L mixture retains 9 kg of solute.','教學65%條件合格回收率與80%總抽回比不同。~Teaching acceptable recovery of 65% differs from gross pumping of 80%.'],timeline=[{'year':'2008','event':'橘郡GWRS地下水補注系統正式啟用。~Orange County groundwater replenishment system begins operation.'},{'year':'2015','event':'橘郡GWRS完成第一階段擴建里程碑。~Orange County GWRS completes its initial expansion milestone.'},{'year':'2023','event':'橘郡GWRS完成官方所列最終擴建。~Orange County GWRS completes its documented final expansion.'}],codes=['USGS OFR 02-89：人工補注與包氣帶研究背景。~USGS OFR 02-89: artificial recharge and vadose-zone research context.','OCWD官方問答：設施歷史及補注途徑資料。~OCWD official FAQ: facility history and recharge-pathway information.'],landmarks=['橘郡地下水補注系統~Orange County Groundwater Replenishment System','Sand Hollow水庫人工補注研究~Sand Hollow reservoir managed-recharge study'],place={'name':'加州芳泉谷地區（概略）~Fountain Valley district, California (approximate)','country':'美國~United States','lat':33.70,'lng':-117.95,'query':'Orange County Water District GWRS Fountain Valley'},sources=S,vendors=[entity('橘郡水區','Orange County Water District','https://www.ocwd.com/','地下水管理與補注','Groundwater management and replenishment','GWRS運轉及官方案例發布機關','GWRS operator and official case publisher'),entity('美國地質調查所','United States Geological Survey','https://www.usgs.gov/','水文與地質研究','Hydrologic and geologic research','Sand Hollow與包氣帶研究來源，非設備供應商','Source of Sand Hollow and vadose-zone research, not an equipment supplier')],related=['b298','b299'],architectureNodes=[['水源與池面水量','Source and basin balance'],['包氣帶與限制層','Vadose zone and restrictive layers'],['儲存與水位隆起','Storage and groundwater mounding'],['水質與熱示蹤','Quality and thermal tracing'],['回收與年度水量帳','Recovery and annual accounting']],architectureEdges=[[0,1],[1,2],[2,3],[3,4],[1,3]],units=U)
audit('b297',[('1000-300-100',600,1e-9),('.6/(.3-.1)',3,1e-9),('1/(1/1+.2/.01)',.04762,.00001),('1000/(10000*.2)',.5,1e-9),('.24/(10*.3*.8)',.1,1e-9),('(.05*4+.15/.5*(1-math.exp(-2)))*1000',459.4,.1),('(100*10+200*40)/300',30,1e-9),('.2/((.25*4.18+.75*2)/(.25*4.18))',.0821,.0001),('6500/10000*100',65,1e-9),('1000*(300-20)*.8',224000,1e-9)])
